### 4. DOES ANY SCORED VERDICT FLIP UNDER THE ALTERNATIVE?
###    V_evade's FULL G-VAR2 verdict is REFUSE at 38/38 on all six
###    routes BECAUSE VAR-S REFUSES (max D_c 1.24e-09 << tau_var);
###    the conjunction 3.4 needs VAR-S ADMIT or scale_degenerate,
###    so VAR-F cannot rescue it whatever the fibre declaration.
###    P-V1 is adjudicated on VAR-S ALONE and never touches VAR-F.
###    P-G1 is adjudicated on VAR-S ALONE (crossing amplitude).
###    => NO SCORED VERDICT OF THIS BATCH FLIPS. The defect is
###       LATENT: it is a guard that does not guard, and it would
###       bind the moment a candidate with a non-determinant
###       nuisance argument reached VAR-S ADMIT or
###       scale_degenerate.

